. * 场景 4：bycoefs 面板（2x2 竖排）
. * ============================================================
. sysuse auto, clear
(1978 automobile data)

. label variable mpg "每加仑英里数"

. label variable weight "车重"

. label variable length "车长"

. label variable turn "转弯半径"

. label variable price "价格"

. 
. forvalues i = 3/5 {
  2.     quietly regress price mpg weight length turn if rep78==`i'
  3.     estimates store rep_`i'
